### 2. Verificar usuarios huérfanos (Autenticados sin perfil)

Revisa si hay usuarios que dependen del fallback `company_id = 1`.

```sql
SELECT 
    au.id AS auth_user_id,
    au.email,
    au.created_at,
    p.id AS profile_id
FROM 
    auth.users au
LEFT JOIN 
    public.profiles p ON au.id = p.id
WHERE 
    p.id IS NULL;
```

